      "text": [
        " قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) لِيَنْصَحِ الرَّجُلُ مِنْكُمْ أَخَاهُ كَنَصِيحَتِهِ لِنَفْسِهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ibn Mahboub, from Amro Bin Shimr, from Jabir, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> said: ‘Let the man from you advise his brother like his correcting his own self’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Ibn Mahbub has narrated from ‘Amr ibn Shamir from Jabir from abu Ja’far (a.s.) who has said the following: “The Messenger of Allah has said, ‘Every man among you must provide advice to his brother (in belief) just like the advice for his own self.’” "
        ]
      }
